# APKs are delivered via GitHub raw links, never from this domain.
# Excluding them keeps the Vercel function bundle under the size limit
# (repo APKs had grown to ~460 MB, which failed every deployment).
*.apk
*.aab
# PC builds are delivered via GitHub raw links too, never from this domain.
# The repo's .exe files (~195 MB) were being swept into the Python serverless
# function bundle (233 MB total), which failed every deployment from
# 26 Nov 2026 with RUNTIME_DEPENDENCY_INSTALLATION_FAILED.
*.exe
*.dll
